      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Until now, Web Search on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore delivered that information to agents through AgentCore Gateway , a capability of Amazon Bedrock AgentCore.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-the-web-search-api-on-amazon-bedrock-agentcore/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
